(text "LED reverse-voltage protection"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.9600 143.5100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "027b7827-9f05-43dc-8199-212aaf3f2114")
	)

(text "If F30001 opens and +24V_FUSED falls towards zero, R30002 discharges the gate\nof Q30001. Q30001 turns off, allowing current to flow from +24V_RAW through\nR30003 and the red LED D30004 to GND. D30004 illuminates and D30005 turns off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.9600 130.7500 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0d09251a-98f6-46a8-b381-e139f8ec9b53")
	)

(text "D30006 is an SMBJ36CA bidirectional TVS diode connected after F30001. It\ndiverts positive or negative surge current between +24V_FUSED and GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.9600 167.6400 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "13535633-6777-467f-a193-59f806a16d04")
	)

(text "Purpose and power path"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.8800 55.6660 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "457286a9-0f26-49cc-949f-fa0fad9bb188")
	)

(text "Transient suppression"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.9600 162.6200 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "563f3e21-d38c-4ebf-97b5-7d2b850d3024")
	)

(text "Fuse and TVS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 307.3400 34.2900 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 86 96 108 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "97b4a093-114d-4387-86d7-7bb6aec4d394")
	)

(text "24 V Input Fuse, Status Indicators and Transient Protection"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.8800 41.4800 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.6 2.6)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 25 47 72 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9983f878-6665-471e-b6aa-ea813ec46742")
	)

(text "With correct input polarity and an intact fuse, +24V_FUSED is approximately\nequal to +24V_RAW. Current flows through R30005 and the green LED D30005 to\nGND, so D30005 illuminates.\n\nR30004 and R30002 form a divider that drives the gate of Q30001. Q30001 is an\nN-channel BSS138N MOSFET: pin 1 is the gate, pin 2 is the source connected to\nGND, and pin 3 is the drain connected to the red LED anode and R30003.\n\nThe positive gate voltage turns Q30001 on. Its drain-source channel bypasses\nD30004 and holds the red LED anode close to GND, keeping D30004 off. Current\nfrom +24V_RAW then flows through R30003 and Q30001 to GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.9600 90.1100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a2ea48ac-867a-435a-9908-210ec77ba849")
	)

(text "D30003 and D30007 are CD0603-B0240R Schottky diodes connected in antiparallel\nwith D30004 and D30005, respectively. They limit reverse voltage across the\nLEDs approximately to their forward voltage."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.9600 148.5300 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a465345c-0158-4502-935f-ed5ed6c609c2")
	)

(text "Normal operation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.9600 85.0900 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a725dbc8-5ae7-4c74-bdf5-8f4545e24c0c")
	)

(text "F30001 connects +24V_RAW to +24V_FUSED. It is marked 5 A / 125 V and provides\novercurrent protection according to its time-current characteristic. The\n+24V_FUSED net supplies the downstream input circuitry.\n\nD30005 indicates voltage after the fuse. D30004 indicates loss of the fused\nsupply while the raw input remains present. D30006 suppresses voltage\ntransients between +24V_FUSED and GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.8800 60.6860 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ded4e8a4-a170-4e22-a30d-31ee296ad4df")
	)

