(text "R30019 (20 mOhm / 1 W) carries the current delivered to BUS24. Its voltage\ndrop is proportional to current: 20 mV per ampere. Current is calculated as I\n= (BUS24_PRE_SHUNT - BUS24) / 0.02 Ohm. At 3.5 A, the drop is 70 mV and\ndissipation is approximately 0.245 W. Increasing R30019 increases measurement\nsensitivity, voltage drop and heat. The current-measurement circuitry connects\nelsewhere in the project."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.9600 269.2400 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "07dd7d24-fde7-4985-9134-701e72985310")
	)

(text "EFUSE_OUT feeds L30001, a ferrite bead rated 120 Ohm at 100 MHz / 6 A. L30001\nattenuates high-frequency noise; its stated impedance is not its DC\nresistance. C30008 (100 uF), C30006 (1 uF) and C30007 (100 nF) provide local\nenergy storage and bypass noise to GND. BUS24_PRE_SHUNT is the filtered supply\nbefore R30019; BUS24 is the supply after R30019."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.8800 246.1060 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1be3f971-00e3-4120-ba86-7063d7e91e69")
	)

(text "Power path and filtering"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.8800 241.0860 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(bold yes)
				(color 0 100 110 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "396e4b25-5d79-41f7-913c-0660018cecfa")
	)

(text "R30017 (10 kOhm) limits current through the green LED D30010. The LED\nindicates voltage on BUS24, downstream of the shunt. At 24 V and approximately\n2 V LED forward voltage, LED current is 2.2 mA.\n\nR30018 and R30016 (100 kOhm each) form a 200 kOhm discharge path from BUS24 to\nGND. They draw 120 uA at 24 V and slowly discharge the connected capacitance\nafter power removal. Reducing their resistance accelerates discharge and\nincreases continuous power consumption."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 441.9600 295.9100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(thickness 0.18)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4ed8b332-59e3-4562-a043-854a36d582e3")
	)

